stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Queued
    Queued --> Running : a runner picks the job up
    state Running {
        [*] --> Checkout
        Checkout --> Build
        Build --> Test
        Test --> [*]
    }
    Running --> Passed : every stage is green
    Running --> Failed : a stage exits non-zero
    Failed --> Queued : retry
    Passed --> [*]
